    <!-- Effective Output Line Source per period group (Output Lines Source group mux). Period 1 always uses the main source (line_out_source / linecompl_out_source). When the Line Sel buffer (reload_line_sel) is OFF every period uses the main source, so these collapse to the main source and every waveform vertex renders identically to the pre-buffer behavior. When it is ON: EVEN displayed periods (P2/P4/P6/P8) take the buffered source; ODD displayed periods after the first (P3/P5/P7) take the main source when the Swapping Enable feature is effective (buff<->main swap on each TC) or the buffered source when it is not (buff is copied into main once and held). Mirrors the existing period/compare buffered swap/copy machinery. -->
