    <!-- Run duration in counts (uniform counts-per-pixel = cuw_maxper / cuw_tmgPxPer; multiply-first), then corrected for dead time: an ACTIVE run (cuw_tgL = 1) loses cuw_tgDtSel counts (activation delayed), an INACTIVE run gains them (it ends later). max(0, ...) guards the case where the dead time is longer than the ideal active pulse (the output never activates). cuw_tgDtSel = 0 outside custom dead-time mode, so the durations are unchanged there. -->
