    <!-- Up/Down only: in the up/down triangle each compare value is matched twice per period (once while counting up at the main value, once while counting down at the asymmetric/buffered value). The down-leg crossing in displayed period k is at boundary_k - pxc(Dn). The whole 0..period range is swept, so these dots are always shown when up/down counting. -->
